## FAQ

### What does it mean to disable telemetry?

It means stopping Windows telemetry from collecting usage and diagnostic information and sending it to Microsoft. In practice, how to disable telemetry in Windows 11 comes down to services, the log, hosts and firewall, and the program handles all four.

### How do I turn off tracking on my computer?

Apply the tracking fixes in this program and leave the hosts and firewall blocks on. System settings toggles alone leave several services running.

### How do I disable Microsoft spyware?

What people call spyware here is the built-in data collection. Disabling telemetry, Cortana and keystroke collection, then blocking the reporting servers, covers it.
